# Write the poses RefineMap optimised, one line per keyframe in the same
# "<i>.pcd tx ty tz qw qx qy qz" format poses.txt uses, to file_path (whose
# parent directory must exist; an existing file is replaced). Served by
# hba_node (`syncai_mapping`, in SyncAI-Robot-Workspace) on the relative name
# `save_poses`, so it lands on <robot_id>/hba/save_poses. Not called by the
# backend. Moved here from SyncAI-Fast-LIO2's `interface` package in 2026-09
# with the node that serves it.
#
# Deliberately a separate file from the map's own poses.txt: the refined
# poses are a candidate, and replacing the originals is the operator's call.
string file_path
---
bool success
string message
